- Rust (package manager: cargo)
- Monorepo (cargo), 1 package: \`crates/core\`
<!-- claude-kit:end stack -->

<!-- claude-kit:begin commands -->
## Commands

\`\`\`bash
go build ./...              # build
go test ./...               # test
go vet ./...                # lint
gofmt -w .                  # format
cargo build                 # build
cargo test                  # test
cargo clippy --all-targets  # lint
cargo fmt                   # format
\`\`\`
<!-- claude-kit:end commands -->

## Conventions

